# Ripgrep reads .gitignore first. These negations un-ignore local GT6 trees for
# `rg` in the terminal and for Agent Grep when it is not using Instant Grep.
!gt6_code/
!gt6_code/**
!gt6_referencable_port_code/
!gt6_referencable_port_code/**
!gt6_referencable_port_code/**/*.png
!ktfruaddon/
!ktfruaddon/**
!*.png
